<HEAD>PART 4010&#x2014;ANNUAL FINANCIAL AND ACTUARIAL INFORMATION REPORTING
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>29 U.S.C. 1302(b)(3), 1310.
</PSPACE></AUTH>
<SOURCE>
<HED>Source:</HED><PSPACE>61 FR 34022, July 1, 1996, unless otherwise noted.
